# Everything under data/ is generated at runtime, never program input:
# telemetry recordings, the rolling log, the persisted tune, this rig's pad
# calibration and GUI preferences. The code recreates the directory on demand
# (os.makedirs(REC_DIR, exist_ok=True) before every write), so a fresh clone
# needs nothing seeded here.
#
# Two of these are actively harmful to ship: tc_padmap.json would override
# DEFAULT_PADMAP with one specific controller's axis mapping, and tc_tune.json
# would override the in-code PID defaults for everyone who clones.
data/

__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Python virtual environments (the launchers probe .venv\Scripts\pythonw.exe)
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Stray desktop captures at the repo root. docs/*.png is intentional and kept.
/Screenshot*.png

# Build output. build/fh6tc.spec is the recipe and IS tracked; everything
# PyInstaller generates is not.
dist/
build/work/
build/_smoke*
*.manifest
build/out/
